**Files** — `#files-path` at `/`, root has `bin`/`etc`/`home`/`usr`/`var`, `/home/user` has `Documents`/`Downloads`/`Pictures`, double-click + `#files-up` ✓
**Notepad** — `#tabs` with `.tab` items, `#new-tab`, `#editor` textarea, tab switching, full localStorage persistence ✓

Everything is implemented with working behavior — file navigation, window dragging, tab creation/closing/renaming, and localStorage round-tripping all function. Here is the final file:

